]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in St. Louis County came in under 90% of normal in November to December 39 times in 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle ran 155% of normal in March to April and 41% in November to December. The 2026 year so far shows January to February at 42% and June to July at 129%. Grid 22059 had its driest year in 1976 at 58%.</p>"}
